/*
 * Alpaca Weather Station for Arduino Opta
 *
 * This weather station implements ASCOM Alpaca ObservingConditions and SafetyMonitor APIs
 * for astronomical observatory automation.
 *
 * Features:
 * - S700 weather station integration via RS485
 * - Rain sensor monitoring (Kemo M152K)
 * - Web interface for safety limit configuration
 * - Flash storage for persistent settings
 * - Real-time safety monitoring with configurable thresholds
 *
 * Hardware:
 * - Arduino Opta (main controller)
 * - S700 weather station (RS485)
 * - Kemo M152K rain sensor (analog)
 * - Ethernet connectivity
 *
 * Cleaned up version with improved:
 * - Code organization and structure
 * - Error handling and safety logic
 * - Constants and configuration management
 * - Function documentation and naming
 * - Memory efficiency and type safety
 */

